OL,3,GNEWSAStabbing victim 'will live forever
OL,4,Ain our hearts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has said a father-of-four who
OL,7,Fdied following a stabbing "will live
OL,8,Fforever in our hearts".
OL,10,FKevin Lewis, also known as Abdul
OL,11,FKareem, died in hospital two days after
OL,12,Fpolice were called to a disturbance at
OL,13,Fan address in Blackley, Manchester, at
OL,14,Fabout 02:45 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe 36-year-old was described by his
OL,17,Ffamily as "a devout Muslim" and "a kind
OL,18,Fand caring person whose warmth touched
OL,19,Fthe hearts of everyone who knew him".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
