OL,3,GNEWSAStabbing victim 'will live forever
OL,4,Ain our hearts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman, 29, initially arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of wounding and assaulting a
OL,8,Fpolice officer in connection with the
OL,9,Fincident has now been arrested on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of murder. She has been
OL,11,Fbailed pending further investigation.
